@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenantId = S-NET
@evalId = 8e96e628-e43d-45e3-a95e-b266e1fa5503

### 1. List All Registered Tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants

# Response:
# [
#   {
#     "id": "S-NET",
#     "name": "S-NET Communications",
#     "description": "Telecommunications & Enterprise IT Support",
#     "created_at": "2026-08-18T10:00:00"
#   }
# ]

### 2. Create a New Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "BrightWave",
  "name": "BrightWave Retail",
  "description": "E-Commerce Customer Experience & Retail Support"
}

# Response:
# {
#   "status": "created",
#   "tenant": {
#     "id": "BrightWave",
#     "name": "BrightWave Retail"
#   }
# }

### 3. Upload Guideline PDF (Lossless Markdown & Vector DB Indexing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/upload-pdf
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_guideline.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample_guideline.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

# Response:
# {
#   "status": "success",
#   "tenant_id": "S-NET",
#   "document_id": 1,
#   "filename": "sample_guideline.pdf",
#   "page_count": 8,
#   "criteria": {
#     "category_weights": { "Soft Skills": 0.25, "Technical Knowledge": 0.50, "Process Knowledge": 0.25 }
#   },
#   "policies_indexed": 6
# }

### 4. Get Converted Lossless Markdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/markdown

# Response:
# {
#   "markdown": "# QA Form Guideline - S-NET Communications\n\n| CALL LINE ITEMS | DEFINITION |...",
#   "filename": "sample_guideline.pdf",
#   "uploaded_at": "2026-08-18T10:05:00"
# }

