### 11. Assemble & Preview LLM Prompt (Prompt Builder Inspection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/preview-prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "Call",
  "agent_name": "Alex",
  "transcript": "[00:00] Agent: Thank you for calling S-NET Communications. My name is Alex how can I help you today?\n[00:05] Client: I need help with my account bill.\n[00:08] Agent: I can help with that. May I verify your full name and company?\n[00:15] Client: John Doe, Acme Corp.\n[00:20] Agent: Thank you John. Your balance is $100.\n[00:25] Client: Thanks Alex!\n[00:28] Agent: Thank you for Choosing S-NET and have a great day."
}

# Response:
# {
#   "prompt": "You are a STRICT Call Quality Assurance Auditor evaluating a Call interaction...\n\nCOMPANY EVALUATION CATEGORIES & WEIGHTS:\n• Soft Skills: 25.0% of total QA score...",
#   "matched_policies": [
#     {
#       "title": "S-NET Communications - Customer Verification & Identification Standard",
#       "content": "S-NET Communications Standard: All 4 details must be validated...",
#       "similarity": 0.72
#     }
#   ],
#   "intense_moments": [],
