### 12. Run Dynamic QA Analysis (Optionally with Custom Approved Prompt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "Call",
  "agent_name": "Alex",
  "transcript": "[00:00] Agent: Thank you for calling S-NET Communications. My name is Alex how can I help you today?\n[00:05] Client: I need help with my account bill.\n[00:08] Agent: I can help with that. May I verify your full name and company?\n[00:15] Client: John Doe, Acme Corp.\n[00:20] Agent: Thank you John. Your balance is $100.\n[00:25] Client: Thanks Alex!\n[00:28] Agent: Thank you for Choosing S-NET and have a great day."
}

